01:03:13.678 --> 01:03:14.812
cactus

1089
01:03:15.413 --> 01:03:16.647
Are you alive?

1090
01:03:17.148 --> 01:03:20.251
No, why do you keep asking me why I killed him?

1091
01:03:20.318 --> 01:03:22.153
I thought you were going to kill me

1092
01:03:22.219 --> 01:03:23.954
Have a grudge against me

1093
01:03:24.822 --> 01:03:26.524
Should I kill you, really?

1094
01:03:26.590 --> 01:03:28.292
- Huh?
- Not a cactus.

1095
01:03:29.060 --> 01:03:30.528
Do you really want to die?

1096
01:03:31.429 --> 01:03:33.097
You just came from the mainland?

1097
01:03:34.498 --> 01:03:35.666
Ah...

1098
01:03:36.167 --> 01:03:38.436
No, in the first place
Why are you bringing your car to the island?

1099
01:03:38.502 --> 01:03:39.937
I didn't even prepare

1100
01:03:40.004 --> 01:03:42.873
Oh, the PD has car-related expenses.
They said they would do everything

1101
01:03:42.940 --> 01:03:44.942
You must have forgotten, just left.

1102
01:03:47.511 --> 01:03:49.113
Oh, why doesn't it explode?

1103
01:03:50.681 --> 01:03:51.982
Call for insurance first

1104
01:03:53.117 --> 01:03:54.452
Wait a minute

1105
01:03:59.657 --> 01:04:02.393
If you go on a boat ride
Can't open again due to bad weather

1106
01:04:02.460 --> 01:04:04.762
Again! Trapped on an island again!

1107
01:04:04.829 --> 01:04:06.263
There is only one room

1108
01:04:06.630 --> 01:04:08.933
Make sure to put in a contrived scene like this
Is there drama?

1109
01:04:08.999 --> 01:04:11.569
Oh, it's contrived.

1110
01:04:11.635 --> 01:04:13.037
Our Taerin is currently appearing in dramas as well.

1111
01:04:13.104 --> 01:04:15.239
The car that was in good condition suddenly broke down.

1112
01:04:15.306 --> 01:04:17.875
Why? Because it has to break down

1113
01:04:17.942 --> 01:04:20.144
What are you looking at!

1114
01:04:21.212 --> 01:04:22.380
what?

1115
01:04:23.013 --> 01:04:24.281
'gas station'?

1116
01:04:25.216 --> 01:04:26.951
‘When you run out of gas’?

1117
01:04:33.324 --> 01:04:34.592
Ah, it's done

1118
01:04:34.658 --> 01:04:36.060
They say there’s a gas station nearby.

1119
01:04:36.660 --> 01:04:37.828
I'll get the oil

1120
01:04:39.764 --> 01:04:40.831
Ah, hey

1121
01:04:41.565 --> 01:04:43.300
Hey, no

1122
01:04:43.367 --> 01:04:46.370
I heard that wild boars appear here earlier.
I received a safety text message

1123
01:04:46.437 --> 01:04:48.706
What if I run into someone while I'm alone?

1124
01:04:49.407 --> 01:04:51.175
Hey, that's more contrived.

1125
01:04:51.609 --> 01:04:55.446
Are you worried that your insurance premiums will go up?
You're not calling, right?

1126
01:04:55.513 --> 01:04:56.447
Ugh

1127
01:04:57.148 --> 01:04:58.849
This is an area excluded from business trip service.

1128
01:04:58.916 --> 01:04:59.917
give it

1129
01:05:00.751 --> 01:05:03.654
Ah, why say that now!

1130
01:05:03.721 --> 01:05:05.022
kid!

1131
01:05:08.058 --> 01:05:11.896
Oh, I really am
I'm a person who follows the milestones.

1132
01:05:12.630 --> 01:05:15.566
The boats cut off and the cars stopped.

1133
01:05:17.101 --> 01:05:19.804
What, have you always lived like that?

1134
01:05:19.870 --> 01:05:21.071
According to the signpost?

1135
01:05:22.506 --> 01:05:23.574
huh?

1136
01:05:24.508 --> 01:05:25.609
no

1137
01:05:26.744 --> 01:05:30.815
A map I've never seen before
I wonder if I've ever followed you

1138
01:05:32.817 --> 01:05:34.351
Um...

1139
01:05:36.220 --> 01:05:38.722
I'm not even sure there's a way

1140
01:05:38.789 --> 01:05:41.759
There were many times I had to go

1141
01:05:42.593 --> 01:05:43.727
Like now?

1142
01:05:44.662 --> 01:05:45.763
Oh, that's right

1143
01:05:46.297 --> 01:05:48.299
You said you liked adventure

1144
01:05:50.768 --> 01:05:52.536
- Wow
-Why?

1145
01:05:52.903 --> 01:05:55.406
I was looking forward to it from the moment I arrived on location.

1146
01:05:55.940 --> 01:05:56.841
What?

1147
01:05:57.641 --> 01:05:59.143
planting trees

1148
01:05:59.643 --> 01:06:01.612
When should I try it?

1149
01:06:01.679 --> 01:06:03.547
If you plant it well like this

1150
01:06:03.614 --> 01:06:07.084
Grow well and neatly
I think there might be

1151
01:06:09.286 --> 01:06:12.990
In order to grow to a size worth seeing...

1152
01:06:13.657 --> 01:06:15.459
It will take about 5 years

1153
01:06:16.927 --> 01:06:18.796
It will be really pretty when the flowers bloom

1154
01:06:18.863 --> 01:06:20.397
What is the language of flowers?

1155
01:06:20.464 --> 01:06:22.099
I won't tell you

1156
01:06:22.166 --> 01:06:23.400
Chi

1157
01:06:26.570 --> 01:06:28.639
- Hey, Seonwoohae.
- Huh?

1158
01:06:29.840 --> 01:06:31.942
you really

1159
01:06:32.009 --> 01:06:34.011
Why did you say you would appear?

1160
01:06:41.318 --> 01:06:43.687
Are you still curious about that?

1161
01:06:44.355 --> 01:06:46.790
The reason why you refused to invite me all this time is

1162
01:06:46.857 --> 01:06:48.425
It makes so much sense.

1163
01:06:48.859 --> 01:06:50.895
But what I accepted was

1164
01:06:50.961 --> 01:06:54.131
No matter how much I think about it, I still don’t understand it.

1165
01:06:55.299 --> 01:06:57.735
To a lost friend

1166
01:06:58.903 --> 01:06:59.970
heart

1167
01:07:04.208 --> 01:07:05.943
your heart is true

1168
01:07:06.010 --> 01:07:07.311
You look great

1169
01:07:10.281 --> 01:07:11.515
interest

1170
01:07:12.883 --> 01:07:15.886
The language of flowers from the trees we planted

1171
01:07:17.988 --> 01:07:20.558
What, when did you search?

1172
01:07:20.624 --> 01:07:21.825
I didn't have time to do that

1173
01:07:21.892 --> 01:07:23.360
You made it up, why?

1174
01:07:24.194 --> 01:07:26.397
Puhahahaha!

1175
01:07:27.631 --> 01:07:31.068
You wrote it very well.

1176
01:08:07.104 --> 01:08:08.606
What is it, can I reach it?

1177
01:08:09.106 --> 01:08:12.076
I can reach it, I can reach it, I can reach it, uh!

1178
01:08:12.910 --> 01:08:14.612
I reached it, I reached it!

1179
01:08:16.513 --> 01:08:18.315
I'm so crazy I'm dying

1180
01:08:19.450 --> 01:08:21.285
Calm down, I won't eat you.

1181
01:08:36.066 --> 01:08:37.267
If you don't like it, avoid it.

1182
01:08:38.469 --> 01:08:39.603
What if you don’t like it?

1183
01:08:42.439 --> 01:08:43.707
Thank goodness

1184
01:10:03.320 --> 01:10:04.555
{\an8}What happens to us now?

1185
01:10:04.621 --> 01:10:07.725
{\an8}We even kissed
You can't go back before that.

1186
01:10:08.058 --> 01:10:09.426
{\an8}What did I do?

1187
01:10:09.493 --> 01:10:11.929
{\an8}I think it would be more awkward if I went quietly.

1188
01:10:11.995 --> 01:10:13.430
{\an8}You are nineteen

1189
01:10:13.997 --> 01:10:15.733
{\an8}It stands up like a stone beak

1190
01:10:16.100 --> 01:10:18.802
{\an8}It pops up at any time
I tripped

1191
01:10:19.103 --> 01:10:21.138
{\an8}The original publisher went bankrupt...

1192
01:10:21.205 --> 01:10:24.942
{\an8}The original work is out of print
The contract only says ‘original author’.

1193
01:10:25.008 --> 01:10:26.310
{\an8}Why come back!

1194
01:10:26.376 --> 01:10:28.178
{\an8}After that happened, mom
You didn't come!

1195
01:10:28.946 --> 01:10:30.848
{\an8}Can I go on a date here?

1196
01:10:30.914 --> 01:10:31.749
{\an8}With whom?

1197
01:10:32.282 --> 01:10:33.383
{\an8}A guy you like?

1198
01:10:33.717 --> 01:10:36.720
{\an8}I'm curious about what you're doing
This is the beginning of interest.

1199
01:10:36.787 --> 01:10:38.989
{\an8}If the guy who kicked me hangs on

1200
01:10:39.056 --> 01:10:40.390
{\an8}Isn’t it rather good?

1201
01:10:40.457 --> 01:10:41.925
{\an8}If I don't meet anyone

1202
01:10:42.559 --> 01:10:43.961
Would you like to meet me?

